      "effect": "Replace 40 whole-universe status processes with 1 native batch. No proof skipping, archive edits or timeout exception."
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
      "change": "Add a native inventory-only roster projection that returns records and unreadable workspace IDs without full summaries/briefings; process all 87 historical revisions with fresh read context per Git snapshot.",
